cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "arabic-led-text-pipeline: Unicode Arabic text rendering for LED dot-matrix displays"
abstract: >-
  An open host-to-microcontroller pipeline that renders correctly shaped Unicode
  Arabic text to monochrome LED dot-matrix displays (P10, MAX7219, and addressable
  LED chains), performing HarfBuzz-based contextual shaping and rasterisation on the
  host so the microcontroller receives only a pre-rendered 1-bit framebuffer.
type: software
